{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>黃仁勳</p>\n<p>瓊斯在電話會議上表示，黃仁勳是在披露了自己的某些個人行為後辭去CEO職務的，這些行為「與公司的行為準則、標準和文化規範不符」。</p>\n<p>「英偉達董事會一致接受了他的辭呈，並且無意讓黃仁勳重新出任CEO。」瓊斯稱。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1118/99dae251b3c235d.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>黃仁勳</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:22:20.416612+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T23:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T18:37:37.518579+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:49.478279+00:00","content_hash":"deb20841f619b9c6657b394098d18879ce864ac9f42661fc5f2f396f62f01d15","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:22:20.416612+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}